    "  aws_sqs_queue           id = queue URL    (sqs/queue.go SetId(QueueUrl))",
    "  aws_lambda_function     id = function name (lambda/function.go SetId(name))",
    "The SQS/Lambda disagreement is on the *scanned* side, not here — see",
    "awkward.scanned.json. Terraform never reads this file; the leading",
    "underscore keys exist for the reader."
